  "implementation": "Replace the enabled per-profile shared atomic counter array with 64 fixed 128-byte-aligned stripes. Each physical thread holds only a numeric TLS stripe id; collisions still use relaxed atomic adds. No generated state/metrics owner enters TLS. Disabled metrics retain None and allocate no counter backing. Snapshot aggregation wraps modulo u64 and existing counter names remain available.",
